 "strings": [
  {
   "id": 26,
   "en": "I'd often had the same dream.",
   "cell": "r11c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 30,
   "en": "Sitting alone in the dark,",
   "cell": "r12c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 32,
   "en": "a girl looking at me as if in prayer.",
   "cell": "r13c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 37,
   "en": "Her eyes were lovely, and so very sad,",
   "cell": "r15c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 41,
   "en": "she always said:\n",
   "cell": "r16c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 45,
   "en": "???",
   "cell": "r19c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 49,
   "en": "Forgive us... Please, forgive us...",
   "cell": "r21c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 53,
   "en": "We have touched the forbidden again...",
   "cell": "r23c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 57,
   "en": "We have brought calamity to this world...",
   "cell": "r27c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 59,
   "en": "Even if it was a fate decreed,\nthe fault is ours...",
   "cell": "r29c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 61,
   "en": "The imperial sword is key...",
   "cell": "r33c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 62,
   "en": "I may place a heavy burden\non you, and so...",
   "cell": "r35c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 65,
   "en": "Forgive me, for I am powerless...",
   "cell": "r39c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 68,
   "en": "When I wake,",
   "cell": "r45c3",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 70,
   "en": "I would always forget almost all she said.",
   "cell": "r46c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 73,
   "en": "All I remember",
   "cell": "r48c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 76,
   "en": "was the light glittering around her sheer hair",
   "cell": "r49c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 79,
   "en": "and her sad eyes.",
   "cell": "r50c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 82,
   "en": "That it was an omen of battle,",
   "cell": "r52c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 84,
   "en": "I had no way of knowing then...",
   "cell": "r53c3",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}